@Barber.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5118

GET https://localhost:7145/api/tenant
X-Tenant-Slug: demo

### Register owner
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/register
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner@demo.shop","password":"DemoPass123","firstName":"Demo","lastName":"Owner","phone":"+491700000001"}

### Register staff
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/register
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"staff@demo.shop","password":"StaffPass123","firstName":"Staff","lastName":"Member","phone":"+491700000002"}

### Login owner
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/login
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner@demo.shop","password":"DemoPass123"}

### Refresh (uses the refresh cookie, no body)
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/refresh
X-Tenant-Slug: demo

### Logout (expect 204, uses the refresh cookie, no body)
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/logout
X-Tenant-Slug: demo

### Me (needs: Authorization: Bearer <access-token>)
GET https://localhost:7145/api/auth/me
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>

### My bookings (needs: Authorization: Bearer <access-token>)
GET https://localhost:7145/api/booking/mine?skip=0&take=5
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>

### Create booking (needs: Authorization: Bearer <access-token>)
POST https://localhost:7145/api/booking
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{"serviceId":"e1e1e1e1-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","staffId":"a1a1a1a1-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","startsAt":"2026-09-28T14:30:00.000Z","notes":"Test"}

### Change booking status (Owner or owning barber)
PATCH https://localhost:7145/api/booking/<id>/status
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"Confirmed"}

### Barbers (public)
GET https://localhost:7145/api/staff
X-Tenant-Slug: demo

### Services (public)
GET https://localhost:7145/api/service
X-Tenant-Slug: demo

### Create service (Owner only)
POST https://localhost:7145/api/service
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{"barbershopId":"73f1e611-9f30-48d2-8ce6-531610f6f676","name":"TEST USLUGA","price":1000,"durationMinutes":30,"slotMinutes":30}

### Update service (Owner only)
PATCH https://localhost:7145/api/service/e1e1e1e1-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":2100}

### Deactivate staff (Owner only)
PATCH https://localhost:7145/api/staff/a1a1a1a1-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{"isActive":false}

### Working hours (Owner only)
GET https://localhost:7145/api/workinghours?barbershopId=73f1e611-9f30-48d2-8ce6-531610f6f676
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>

### Replace working hours (Owner only)
PUT https://localhost:7145/api/workinghours
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{"barbershopId":"73f1e611-9f30-48d2-8ce6-531610f6f676","hours":[{"day":1,"open":"09:00","close":"20:00","isClosed":false},{"day":2,"open":"09:00","close":"20:00","isClosed":false},{"day":3,"open":"09:00","close":"20:00","isClosed":false},{"day":4,"open":"09:00","close":"20:00","isClosed":false},{"day":5,"open":"09:00","close":"20:00","isClosed":false},{"day":6,"open":"09:00","close":"18:00","isClosed":false},{"day":0,"open":"00:00","close":"00:00","isClosed":true}]}

### Shop with hours, staff and services (public)
GET https://localhost:7145/api/barbershop
X-Tenant-Slug: demo

### Change password (needs: Authorization: Bearer <access-token>)
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/change-password
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword":"DemoPass123","newPassword":"DemoPass456"}

