### Admin: list tenants (Development only, needs X-Admin-Key)
GET http://localhost:5118/api/admin/tenants
X-Admin-Key: dev-admin-key-not-for-production

### Admin: provision tenant (creates DB, migrates, registers in catalog)
POST http://localhost:5118/api/admin/tenants
X-Admin-Key: dev-admin-key-not-for-production
Content-Type: application/json

{"slug":"acme","databaseName":"barber_t_acme"}

### Admin: tenant setup progress
GET http://localhost:5118/api/admin/tenants/acme
X-Admin-Key: dev-admin-key-not-for-production
